{"unit_id":"yoyococo1234__dsh-drag-graft#card-zh","repo":"yoyococo1234/dsh-drag-graft","commit":"40d791891cd460453feab43f550bf90525750b99","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-drag-graft 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话与工作区拖拽引用插件。它在侧栏行和对话区之间识别拖放操作，通过宿主输入服务把其他会话插入草稿为原生引用 chip，也可把工作区文件夹插成目录引用；插入后可继续编辑消息再发送。插件会检查当前会话、避免自引用，并读取宿主的引用数量上限；文件夹引用在相关服务不可用时可回退为路径文本，会话 chip 插入失败时则回退为引用消息。适合需要在当前提问中带入其他会话或工作区上下文的 DSH Web 用户。无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:647-693","client.js:566-608","client.js:276-310","package.json:54-60"]}
{"unit_id":"yoyococo1234__dsh-drag-graft#card-en","repo":"yoyococo1234/dsh-drag-graft","commit":"40d791891cd460453feab43f550bf90525750b99","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-drag-graft lets DSH web users drag sidebar sessions into a draft as reference chips and keep typing before sending. Workspace folders can also be inserted as references. It checks self references and the host limit; failed session insertion falls back to sending a reference message.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:647-693","client.js:566-608","client.js:276-310","package.json:54-60"]}
